OL,3,GNEWSAPavement driving defended as roads
OL,4,Aunder pressure
OL,5,
OL,6,FA committee has defended its approach
OL,7,Fto the growing issue of vehicles
OL,8,Fmounting pavements in an island
OL,9,Fcommunity, saying it was unavoidable in
OL,10,Fsome places.
OL,12,FAfter a question from Deputy Ross Le
OL,13,FBrun, Guernsey's Environment and
OL,14,FInfrastructure Committee said there was
OL,15,Fno single solution to road safety
OL,16,Fchallenges.
OL,18,FLe Brun asked why the committee had not
OL,19,Fcarried out a specific risk assessment,
OL,20,Fsafety analysis or monitoring
OL,21,Fprogramme.
OL,23,APub: 25-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
